3. Contributions. Anyone who contributes to the Work (code, art, text, or other)
   does so under a contributor agreement: contributions are assigned to the project
   entity in exchange for contribution credit (POC — a soulbound, earned, non-
   purchasable score) and, where applicable, a share of the project per the
   allocation in economics/allocation.json. This exchange is subject to a definitive
